":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in Godot 4.5 Beta 5\n\n- Not reproducible in Godot 4.5 Beta 4\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta5 - Linux Mint 22.1 (Xia) on X11 - X11 display driver, Multi-window, 1 monitor - OpenGL 3 (Compatibility) - Mesa Intel(R) HD Graphics 4400 (HSW GT2) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i3-4160 CPU @ 3.60GHz (4 threads) - 11.55 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nCreating a material resource and switching scenes or clicking in the scene editor when it's \"closed\" causes the editor to crash. This is the error shown in the Linux terminal:\n```\nthread '<unnamed>' panicked at /home/runner/.cargo/registry/src/index.crates.io-1949cf8c6b5b557f/accesskit_unix-0.17.0/src/context.rs:61:78:\ncalled `Result::unwrap()` on an `Err` value: InterfaceNotFound\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\n```\nThis same error appears on different occasions in an already advanced project but I have no idea of the reasons why or how or in what situations, but starting a new project the error appears by creating a material resource in a 2d node \"closing\" it and changing the scene or by clicking in the scene editor.\n\nSwitching between scenes or click on the scene editor should not crash the editor at any time.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n- Create a new project\n\n- Create 2 scenes with a 2d node as root\n\n- Create a material resource in one of these scenes and \"close\" it.\n\n- Change scene or click on the scene editor\n\n- The editor crashes\n\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf179419-292e-41aa-b805-b223b407547e\" />\n\n<img width=\"1279\" height=\"607\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1ff3bd6a-eedb-438a-9039-ec3162939de7\" />\n\n<img width=\"1280\" height=\"618\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/abb9ed9d-a0f8-4c66-8f2d-3b8d4885b164\" />\n\n\nThe editor crashes\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109732/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109732/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}